              "text": "بھرتی کرنا (bhartī karnā) is built from bhartī, \"filling up; an intake\", on the stem of bharnā, \"to fill\", which CDIAL lists under Sanskrit bharati, \"bears, fills\" (CDIAL 9397), and karnā, \"to do\"."
